      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{610cccebca912c27c4e544bb|full_name}: Impostors disable animations when they're generated, so any avatar with a naked impostor is likely relying on animations for any clothing to be visible. That's not good, because users can disable animations for an avatar in their safety settings as well. (So the impostor isn't really the problem.)\n\nEither way, the creator has made a mistake and needs to know. Please report avatars with incomplete tags.",
